  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programa de Apoyo al Desarrollo Turistico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo al Desarrollo Turistico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Programa tendr como objetivo general contribuir a la generacin de divisas,ingresos y empleo en las reas beneficiarias, mediante la consolidacin del turismo. El objetivo especfico es el incrementode la inversin turstica en los departamentos beneficiarios del Programa, en torno a productos innovadores relacionados conturismo nutico. El programa tiene tres componentes: i) puesta en valor turstica del Corredor del Ro Uruguay y destinosasociados; ii) apoyo al emprendimiento e inversin privada; y iii) establecimiento de un modelo de gestin integral para elCorredor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to help generate foreign currency, revenues, and employment in the beneficiary areas by strengthening tourism. The specific objective is to increase tourism investment in the programs beneficiary departments based on innovative products related to nautical tourism. The program has three components: (i) tourism development along the Uruguay River corridor and associated destinations; (ii) support for private sector entrepreneurship and investment; and (iii) establishment of an integrated management model for the corridor.</narrative>
  </description>
